+  `STREAM_SMOOTH*`, `SHARED_PREFIX`, `CACHE_*`, `DISPLAY_KV_*`). `LOADS=0`, `FUSE`, `PASS=128`, `Q4_TILE`, `SEQ_ROWS`, `L2PF_BLOCKS/KB/THREADS`,
