+- Native, DFlash2 + copies, greedy, one session (tok/s, NCCL / RoCE; two runs each): cedit 101.7, 101.3 / 105.1, 105.8; quote 135.4, 132.8 / 137.9, 138.2; story 43.0, 43.1 / 46.1, 46.6;
